{"v":1,"id":"32d3c186199b","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"What's in a name, the world may say Just breath and sound that fades away","s":11.9,"e":23.78},{"t":"But heaven listens when it's spoken","s":23.78,"e":30.76},{"t":"And chains are loosed and hearts are broken","s":30.76,"e":37.26},{"t":"You call me forward, you call me known","s":37.26,"e":43.66},{"t":"You give me purpose, not my own","s":43.66,"e":50.24},{"t":"Steps are numbered in your sight","s":51.68,"e":57.32},{"t":"To choose the good, to walk the right","s":57.92,"e":63.24},{"t":"They mocked the name you placed on me","s":63.24,"e":69.72},{"t":"They spoke their lies so bitterly","s":69.72,"e":76.08},{"t":"Yet you have seen","s":76.08,"e":80.24},{"t":"You have heard","s":80.82,"e":83.52},{"t":"Every wound from every wound","s":84.12,"e":89.66},{"t":"Those who rise against your truth","s":90.38,"e":96.5},{"t":"Stand on stand not living proof","s":97.28,"e":102.6},{"t":"When the day you send me comes","s":102.6,"e":109.4},{"t":"Every tongue will know you're one","s":111.24,"e":117.04},{"t":"What's in a name?","s":117.7,"e":119.52},{"t":"The power of God","s":119.52,"e":122.78},{"t":"Written in fire","s":123.52,"e":126.0},{"t":"Sealed by blood","s":126.74,"e":129.18},{"t":"Above all names, none compare","s":129.18,"e":135.34},{"t":"When heaven moves at what's declared","s":136.18,"e":142.26},{"t":"What's in a name, life or death","s":143.32,"e":148.9},{"t":"Mercy spoken with every breath","s":149.54,"e":155.46},{"t":"Blessing are those who trust and stand","s":155.46,"e":162.54},{"t":"Calling on the great I Am","s":163.16,"e":168.68},{"t":"You say my name","s":178.08,"e":181.76},{"t":"Is not by chance","s":181.76,"e":184.98},{"t":"Not born of flesh or circumstance","s":185.6,"e":191.1},{"t":"It's spoken firm","s":191.1,"e":195.08},{"t":"Before your throne","s":195.76,"e":198.58},{"t":"A mark that says I'm not alone","s":198.58,"e":204.42},{"t":"They may slander","s":205.82,"e":208.48},{"t":"They may fight, but you will set all things to right.","s":208.48,"e":217.96},{"t":"I will go out, I'll come back in to bring you glory, not for men.","s":219.56,"e":231.58},{"t":"The weight of heaven fills the sound","s":231.58,"e":237.94},{"t":"When your holy name resounds","s":238.78,"e":244.38},{"t":"Fear takes hold","s":245.46,"e":247.74},{"t":"Hearts are torn","s":248.4,"e":250.92},{"t":"When truth is named","s":251.66,"e":254.12},{"t":"A soul is born","s":254.68,"e":258.04},{"t":"What's in a name?","s":258.04,"e":260.96},{"t":"The power of God","s":261.92,"e":264.22},{"t":"Ridden in fire","s":264.92,"e":267.2},{"t":"Sealed by blood","s":268.0,"e":270.6},{"t":"Above all names","s":271.6,"e":274.4},{"t":"None compare","s":275.3,"e":276.94},{"t":"When heaven moves","s":277.76,"e":280.7},{"t":"At what's declared","s":281.62,"e":283.52},{"t":"What's in a name","s":283.52,"e":287.5},{"t":"Hope restored","s":288.48,"e":290.08},{"t":"Salvation in a single","s":291.72,"e":296.2},{"t":"Blessed are those who trust and stand","s":296.2,"e":303.94},{"t":"Calling on the great I Am","s":304.68,"e":310.02},{"t":"Your name shakes the earth below","s":315.54,"e":319.98},{"t":"Your name makes the strong bend low","s":320.52,"e":327.02},{"t":"One name given one way true","s":328.88,"e":333.32},{"t":"By which the lost are made brand new","s":333.32,"e":340.16},{"t":"And blessed are those whose names remain","s":341.08,"e":345.98},{"t":"Written where no love can claim","s":347.46,"e":352.92},{"t":"Everlasting, sealed and sure","s":355.72,"e":359.8},{"t":"Standing firm","s":359.8,"e":362.86},{"t":"They shall endure","s":364.06,"e":366.56},{"t":"What's in a name?","s":367.1,"e":369.52},{"t":"Eternal light","s":370.42,"e":372.5},{"t":"Spoken once","s":373.06,"e":375.76},{"t":"The dark takes flight","s":375.76,"e":379.16},{"t":"Fear gives way","s":379.84,"e":382.06},{"t":"The dead arise","s":383.08,"e":385.44},{"t":"What's in a name","s":385.44,"e":389.5},{"t":"Oh, I need the truth","s":390.44,"e":393.96},{"t":"I trust the life I breathe","s":394.82,"e":398.86},{"t":"Forever held within your flame","s":398.86,"e":405.38},{"t":"I live and stand in your grace","s":409.08,"e":414.88},{"t":"Blessed is the one whose name is known","s":426.52,"e":432.44},{"t":"Written in the book of life","s":434.32,"e":438.52},{"t":"Thank you.","s":444.88,"e":445.42}],"match":null}
